# Build output — rebuilt inside the image, and a stale copy must never win.
dist/
grimfall-web/
grimfall-web.zip

# The uncompressed masters the art pipeline works from. Large, and nothing at
# runtime or build time reads them.
#
# art-source/ ITSELF is deliberately NOT excluded: the build refuses to ship art
# whose provenance file is missing, and art-source/budgies/SOURCE.txt is one of
# them. Excluding the whole folder made the image build fail on a licence check
# — correctly, and confusingly. What is actually tracked in there is three
# megabytes of drawings and text.
art-source/**/*.mp4
art-source/**/*.webm
art-source/**/*.psd
art-source/**/*.aseprite

.git/
node_modules/
*.log
